    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3086" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκερδ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bringing no gain,
				unprofitable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάρις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1484
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				417d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.649
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>). Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>
			<i>without profit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1309a13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.27d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not greedy of gain</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοτιμία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Arist.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.483e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
